              "role": "UserMessage",
              "content": "You are an expert AI RAG Evaluation Judge specializing in document question answering.\nYour role is to rigorously evaluate an AI Generator's response against the retrieved document context and the ground truth.\n\nYou are given:\n1. \"user_query\": The question or analytical objective asked by the user.\n2. \"retrieved_context\": The exact context chunks provided to the generator.\n3. \"ground_truth\": The reference facts / target information from the document.\n4. \"generated_answer\": The final plain-language response produced by the generator.\n5. \"is_negative_case\": Boolean flag. If true, the question cannot be answered from the document, so the generator is EXPECTED to decline or abstain.\n\nEvaluation Criteria:\n1. FAITHFULNESS (Hallucination Detection):\n   - Decompose the \"generated_answer\" into individual atomic factual claims.\n   - For every claim, verify whether it is directly supported by the \"retrieved_context\".\n   - If a claim asserts numbers, names, dates, or relationships NOT found in the context, mark it unsupported (hallucination).\n   - Calculate faithfulness_score = (supported claims count) / (total claims count). If total claims == 0, faithfulness = 1.0.\n\n2. GROUNDEDNESS (Context Anchor):\n   - Rate from 1 to 5:\n     5: Flawlessly grounded in context. Every metric, date, entity, and assertion is strictly drawn from context.\n     4: Highly grounded; negligible minor paraphrasing with no factual distortion.\n     3: Partially grounded; contains unverified inferences or extrapolations beyond context.\n     2: Weakly grounded; multiple facts or numbers cannot be traced to the context.\n     1: Unmitigated hallucination or completely detached from context.\n\n3. ANSWER RELEVANCE:\n   - Rate from 1 to 5:\n     5: Directly and accurately answers what the user asked with clarity and appropriate detail.\n     4: Answers the question well, but has slight extra verbosity.\n     3: Partially addresses the query, but misses a key sub-part.\n     2: Mostly tangential or misunderstands the core question.\n     1: Completely off-topic or refuses to answer an answerable question.\n\n4. ANSWER COMPLETENESS (Recall vs Ground Truth):\n   - Rate from 1 to 5:\n     5: Fully captures all target numbers, entities, and facts present in the ground truth.\n     4: Captures the primary answer; minor secondary details omitted.\n     3: Correct direction, but omits important numerical details or conditions.\n     2: Misses most of the expected information.\n     1: Completely incorrect or fails to provide the expected answer.\n\n5. NEGATIVE REJECTION (Only if is_negative_case is true):\n   - Rate from 1 to 5:\n     5: Correctly and unambiguously states that the document / context does not contain the requested information.\n     1: Hallucinates plausible-sounding facts instead of abstaining.\n\n6. FINAL VERDICT:\n   - \"PASS\" if faithfulness_score >= 0.8 AND groundedness_score >= 3 AND answer_relevance_score >= 3 AND completeness_score >= 3.\n   - Otherwise \"FAIL\".\n\nRespond ONLY with a valid JSON object matching this structure (no markdown formatting, no code blocks):\n{\n  \"claims\": [\n    {\n      \"claim\": \"<atomic factual claim statement>\",\n      \"is_supported\": <true | false>,\n      \"rationale\": \"<brief reason why supported or unsupported by context>\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"faithfulness_score\": <float between 0.0 and 1.0>,\n  \"groundedness_score\": <integer from 1 to 5>,\n  \"answer_relevance_score\": <integer from 1 to 5>,\n  \"completeness_score\": <integer from 1 to 5>,\n  \"negative_rejection_score\": <integer from 1 to 5 or null>,\n  \"verdict\": \"PASS\" | \"FAIL\",\n  \"feedback\": \"<clear 1-2 sentence evaluation summary explaining the verdict>\"\n}\n\n\nTask for Evaluation:\n{\n  \"user_query\": \"How much revenue is currently outstanding?\",\n  \"retrieved_context\": \"[search_documents output]: [ChunkResult(chunk_id='startup_q2_revenue_report.pdf_p2_c01_23506a75', file_id='startup_q2_revenue_report.pdf', text='Collected: \\u25a02,712,768\\\\nOutstanding: \\u25a0369,923', score=1.2202991, metadata={'chunk_index': 1, 'page': 2})]\\n\",\n  \"ground_truth\": \"Outstanding: \\u25a0369,923\",\n  \"generated_answer\": \"The revenue currently outstanding is listed as \\u25a0369,923 in the document.\",\n  \"is_negative_case\": false\n}"
